      "text": "We’re so impressed with the creative things builders are bringing to life with Gemini 4 Carbon.\n\n@GlitterPixely coded a meadow of 52,000 wildflowers and grass blades from scratch in CUDA and C++ with Carbon, synthesizing the wind to match every gust 🧵 https://t.co/AsSLasRV9b",
