      "text": "The November #PixelDrop is here:\n\n✨ Gemini Intelligence is now available on Pixel 10 devices\n🏷️ Keep tabs on your keys, wallet, or luggage with Pixel Tag, available to order starting tomorrow\n📱 Create custom widgets, like a spending tracker or a game day widget with team colors",
