      "text": "Complex materials research is much easier to grasp when you can interact with the underlying math 🧶\n\nFrom a 2026 study on knitted textile mechanics, Gemini 4 Carbon built an interactive 3D visualizer in @Antigravity tracking 110 individual fibers under tension. https://t.co/aWacr1F6X9",
