      "text": "We've given all Pro, Max, Ultra, and Team users one free full reset, across all models and limits. Use it anytime before December 10 at 2:00PM PT.\n\nWe recently fixed a few small issues that used more limits than intended, and the Fable resets didn't do much for those of you who'd",
