      "text": "Take a spin around our Mountain View campus on a GBike... as a pelican riding a bicycle 🚲\n\nBuilt with Gemini 4 Carbon and /swarm in @Antigravity, Pelican Quest turns our Mountain View campus into an open-world 3D browser game. https://t.co/nJs60gAJbq",
